1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read/LUTHER/2005-04/1112624801]
2 CONT * 1490 Mansfeld  Died  18.01.1571 Mansfeld  Hüttenmeister and Ratsherr in Mansfeld.  inherited in 1535 the Luther's family home in Mansfeld 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 1515 in Hettstedt  N., Meme, Immigrated from Holland, Died about 1538, 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married in 1538/39  Margaretthe Luttenrodt [Lutherodt] 
2 CONT * 1490  Widow of Hans Reinecke?
