2 CONC ; B.; † 21/7 1762; (J. 180; R. 280 ff.; Rost. Matr.; Had. Joh. 41; Giessing III. 188 ff. 203; Sl. Kb. Ud. 154; V. f. K. 2 R. VII. 434; P.-T. 8 R. IV. 242); Achelis I, nr. 4230; Kbg. Arrild (1659-1814), f. 244b, opsl. 245 (vielse);
2 CONC  293 (søn Johannes).
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wiberg-net.dk/1474-Aastrup.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Nedergaard volume 10A p 173 (Åstrup) born 19/6 1684 and dead 21/7 1762, married 14/6 1708 in Arrild with Hylleborg Truelsdtr Bertelsen (b in Roest 2/1 1683 d. in Åstrup 14/12 1767) Daughter of Herredsfoged in Nr Rangs
2 CONC trup hrd Truels Bertelsen and Apollonia Lauridsdtr.
2 CONT
2 CONT He become 1705 adj min cum spe succ Åstrup, 31/10 25 sognepræst sammested, død her 21/7 62
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Sønderjydsk Mænedsskrift 1979 s 269 his children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Johannes b 29/9 1709   d. before 1714
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Johannes  b. 17/11 1714  d  maj 1718
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Dorothea Elisabeth  marr 1732 with Byfoged i Haderslev Frederik Klinge
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Anna Apollonia  marr 1742 Borgmester i Hdsl Lütge Asmussen.
