2 CONT Biography for: 10223. Mette Christ Iron Daughter 
2 CONT
2 CONT 10223. Mette Christensdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 00-00-1510 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 00-00-1529 ca. with Lauge Steffensen 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 15-06-1554 in Ribe. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.2.1.1.2.2.1.2.2.2.1 Lauge Steffensen 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1 / 10 1554 in Ribe 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to 2.2.1.1.2.2.1.2.2.2.2 Mette Christensdatter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a councilman in Ribe 1544 - 54 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Source: www.olesenlarsen.dk/slgt/2.2.1.1.2.2.1.2.2.2.1.html) 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Source: The Danish Churches - Ribe Cathedral, Epitafier. Memorial boards. ] 
2 CONT
2 CONT See transcripts folder Genealogy Sonja fathers 1a. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The couple Lauge Steffensen and Metthe Christensdatter Laugis had 6 sons, of whom the eldest, Hans Laugesen, was appointed Bishop of Ribe same year as parents to grow up, and 3 daughters, of whom only Marine (+ 1600) are known. 
2 CONT
2 CONT See also images of paintings by Lauge Steffensen and his wife Metthe folder Slgtsf. Sonja fathers 1a. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.2.1.1.2.2.1.2.2.2.2 Mette Christensdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 15 / 6 1554 in Ribe 
2 CONT
2 CONT She gave birth to 9 children, "which in the present material may be said to be the norm for civil marriages in Ribe. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to 2.2.1.1.2.2.1.2.2.2.1 Lauge Steffensen 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father was Christ Iron Nielsen who are treated as No 1.2.2.2.2.1.2.2.1.1.1.2.1 during Qvistgaard genus. He is so in two ways ancestor Marie (Mitte) Qvistgaard. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Source: www.olesenlarsen.dk/slgt/2.2.1.1.2.2.1.2.2.2.2.html) 
