1 NOTE {geni:about_me} His name is actually Poul Christian Boldich The Latin name version was only used within the church.The Series pastorum of Bevtoft Churchbook https://www.sa.dk/ao-soegesider/da/billedviser?epid=17216067#200995,38062
2 CONC 040 states that he became priest in 1707 and had that position for 20 years and that he was 45 years old when he died. Unfortunately, the burial registry for Bevtoft parish is incomplete .
