1 NAME Henrich Friderich Martin /Nasch (Nass)/
2 GIVN Henrich Friderich Martin
2 _MARNM Nasch (Nass)
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1724
2 PLAC Stralsund
2 ADDR
