2 CONT Karen Jensdatter Varder was born on 5 November 1515 in Ribe, she died in 1570 and was buried on 2 April, aged 45. She is the daughter of the parish priest at St. Kathrine's Church in Ribe, Jens Christensen Varder. (-1547), mag., s
2 CONC gp. at Skt. Kath. K. ca. 1537-47, Skm 1549,1552,1562,1563, FM 1551...71, money master 1571-72,1583-84, Gid. forst. 1589-92.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Jensdatter Varder is married once to Hans Jensen, merchant. Citizen of Vejle
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Jensdatter Varder is married 2nd time to Laurids Thøgersen born in Ribe in 1517. dies 1 Jan 1594 77 years old.
