2 CONT * Anders Nielsen Regel (b. Abt. 1615, d. 23 Dec 1661) (son of Niels Andersen Regel and Ida) was born Abt. 1615 in Arninge, Lolland, and died 23 Dec 1661 in Aaby. He married Maren Fochsdatter With in Horsens, daughter of Foch Albre
2 CONC cht de Witt and Lene Clemensdatter.
2 CONT
