2 CONT * Education: 1635, Student fra Lund.Nr.: 2554.
2 CONT * Stilling 1: Rektor i Horsens.
2 CONT * Stilling 2: Designeret rektor i Aarhus..
2 CONT * Stilling 3: Bet. 1648 - 1661, Sognepræst i Aaby, Hasle herred..
2 CONT
2 CONT * More About Anders Nielsen Regel and Maren Fochsdatter With: Marriage: Horsens.
2 CONT * Children of Anders Nielsen Regel and Maren Fochsdatter With are:  +Karen Andersdatter Riegels, d. Abt. 1713, Århus
