2 CONT
2 CONT Lauge Andersen Vedel (son of Anders Sørensen Vedel and Mette Laugesen) was born 23 Jul 1583 in Ribe, and died 23 Aug 1648 in Ribe. He married Lisbeth Johannesdatter Mauritius on 26 Jul 1618 in Tønder, daughter of Johannis Mauriti.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Notes for Lauge Andersen Vedel:
2 CONT
2 CONT stilling præst Visby kald Trøjborg
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Lauge Andersen Vedel and Lisbeth Johannesdatter Mauritius:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 26 Jul 1618, Tønder.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lauge Andersen Vedel and Lisbeth Johannesdatter Mauritius are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.	Anders Laugesen Vedel, b. 1619, Visby, d. 1660, Vilslev.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.	Elisabeth Laugesøn Vedel, b. 1621, Visby, d. 1621.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.	Bernt Laugesøn, b. 1621, Visby, d. 1631, Begravet i Ribe.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.	Hans Laugesøn, b. 1624, Visby, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT v.	Søfren Laugesøn, b. 1629, Visby, d. 02 May 1681, Rabsted.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi.	Ægidius Laugesøn, b. 17 Jun 1635, Ribe, d. 01 Nov 1686, Brøns.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii.	Jørgen Laugesøn, b. 1638, d. 1638, Begravet 14 august 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii.	Jørgen Laugesøn Vedel, b. 1640, d. date unknown, Bremerholm.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix.	+Johan Vedel, b. 1631, d. 1692.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/v/e/d/Connie-Vedel-Danmark/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0169.html
2 CONT
