1 NAME Henrich Christian /Borchgrevink/
2 GIVN Henrich Christian
2 _MARNM Borchgrevink
2 NICK Henrik Kristian Borchgrevink
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 OCT 1732
2 ADDR
