1 NOTE {geni:about_me} til Estrupgaard og Skodborghus. Nævnes som gudmoder 9 dec 1708 hos Christian Møller på Østerholm mølle (i kirkebogen kaldet Nørremølle).
2 CONT
2 CONT The King approved her marriage to Hans Bachmann 1-21-1715 although they were actually married March 24, 1714. She was born in Husum, near the German border on the west coast of Jutland. He father was Adolf Clausen. He died in 1708
2 CONC . Her first husband was Peter Paulsen who was the District Revenue Officer. They were married in 1705. Peter died in1712.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ægteskabet blev godkendt af Kongen 21. januar 1715. Født i Husum i det nuværende Tyskland. Fødselsdatoen oplyse s som 20. juli 1686, og dødsdagen som 2. december 1745
