1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1746 fru Anna Catharina sal. de Tonsbergs sold  Hoberg Vestre (Gnr. 16, bnr. 14) to vaktmester (caretaker) Michael Jongesen Kjønning.
2 CONT
2 CONT By the Ting of 13 November 1750, Peder Tofteberg owning Godager søndre (Gnr. 94, bnr. 1)  and shortage of funds for clearing Godager søndre and 4  December 1752 Peder Tofteberg sell Godager søndre to Lieutenant Michael Kjønning.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1754 became part of district Albom sold to løytnant Kjønning.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the estate of kapteinløytnant Kjønning Hoberg Vestre is transferred to his son Jacob Cold Kjønning.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1772 Jacob secured the farm (pledged his farm to) to Peter Pipper.
