1 NAME Albregt Andreas Simensen /Cold/
2 GIVN Albregt Andreas Simensen
2 SURN Cold
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1739
2 PLAC Bache
2 ADDR
3 ADR2 Strinda
3 CITY Trondheim
3 STAE Sør-Trøndelag
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
