0 @N6000000004045181510@ NOTE Rector of Nakskov 19. nov. 1620, ordained 3. sept. 1621.
1 CONT Clergyman in Nordberg, became Bishop.
1 CONT Hans Mikkelsen was his close friend. His oldest daughter was married to a clergyman in Adersballe, S.P. Rhodius, who was a student at Roskilde, 1645. This Rhodius was a fine man, but was shamefully treated by the Swedes, when unde
1 CONC r King Carl the 10th Gustav, 1657 - 1658, they invaded Denmark. They confiscated his goods and at last hung him up by his beard. The youngest of his daughters was married to Rhodius, the successor in Adersballe of the Clergyman C.
1 CONC  Møller.
0 @N6000000005441171950@ NOTE Han virket som pers.kap i Eidsvoll 1701 - 13, i Ringebu som sogneprest 1712 - 49. Sognepresten i Ringebu hadde også ansvaret for gudstjenestene i bl.a Sollia på østsiden av Ringebufjellet, og kjørte dit til hest med noen ukers mel
1 CONC lomrom. Han fulgte den såkalte 'prestveien', en merket sti over fjellet, som bl.a passerte Hirisjøen og deretter gikk bratte lia ned i dalen til Sollia kirke. Det fortelles om en gang hesten brakk ryggen da den tunge presten ble s
1 CONC ittende på hesteryggen da hesten skulle 'stalle ved Hirisjøen'
1 CONT De fikk 10 barn.
